* Board 2, circuit 8: the two contour generators (Fig. 9-7), as drawn.
* vx: the +9.3 V rail (Q26's emitter); vtrig: Q12's collector, the V-trigger (high while a
* key is down); n20: Q20's collector (low while a key is down), which feeds the reset of
* both flip-flops through R37. Pins of each section: att (to the ATTACK pot), cap (the
* timing capacitor: both pots' wipers), dec (to the DECAY pot), dump (to the DECAY switch
* and R1401), sdn (to the V-trigger through the left hand controller), sus (the SUSTAIN
* pot's wiper), out.
*
* Filter contour section
.subckt contourf vx vtrig n20 att cap dec dump sdn sus out vn
r26 vtrig a1 10k
c1 a1 b1 0.01u
q1 c1 b1 0 Q2N3392
r5 c1 m1 3.3k
r6 m1 vx 560
q5 att5 m1 vx TIS93
r7 att5 att 100
q4 c4 b4 0 Q2N3392
r4 c4 vx 10k
r3 c4 b1 10k
r14 c1 b4 33k
dcr3 p b4 D1N34A
r29 p vn 16.9k
r33 out p 5.6k
r35 n20 x1 10k
dcr1 x1 b4 D1N34A
q6 vx c1 e6 Q2N3392
r8 e6 vn 10k
r9 e6 b7 4.7k
q7 dec b7 s Q2N3392
r10 s vx 27k
q8 c8 b8 s TIS93
r11 c8 0 100
dcr2 s sdn D1N4004
r13 sus b8 4.7k
r1 b8 0 3k
r17 b8 vn 150k
c5 cap 0 10u
dcr7 cap dump D1N4004
r48 cap b22 10k
q22 c22 b22 out Q2N3392
q21 out c22 e21 TIS93
r50 e21 vx 560
c11 c22 out 47p
.ends
*
* Loudness contour section
.subckt contourl vx vtrig n20 att cap dec dump sdn sus out vn
r28 vtrig a2 10k
c4 a2 b25 0.01u
q25 c25 b25 0 Q2N3392
r40 c25 m2 3.3k
r41 m2 vx 560
q16 att16 m2 vx TIS93
r42 att16 att 100
q15 c15 b15 0 Q2N3392
r39 c15 vx 10k
r38 c15 b25 10k
r56 c25 b15 33k
dcr6 p b15 D1N34A
r27 p vn 16.9k
r24 out p 6.8k
r36 n20 x2 10k
dcr8 x2 b15 D1N34A
q17 vx c25 e17 Q2N3392
r43 e17 vn 10k
r44 e17 b18 4.7k
q18 dec b18 s Q2N3392
r45 s vx 27k
q19 c19 b19 s TIS93
r46 c19 0 100
dcr9 s sdn D1N4004
r57 sus b19 4.7k
r41b b19 0 4.7k
c2 cap 0 10u
dcr4 cap dump D1N4004
r16 cap b3 10k
q3 cc3 b3 e3 Q2N3392
q2 cc3 e3 out Q2N3392
r15 cc3 vx 560
.ends
